{"title":"Career Roadmap · Archivist","role":"Archivist","summary":"An Archivist is responsible for acquiring, organising, preserving, describing and providing access to historical and institutional records. A BA in History is a strong foundation because it develops historical research, source evaluation, chronology, contextual interpretation and documentation skills.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"However, for professional archival positions, especially specialist and government roles, a postgraduate qualification or specialised training in Archives/Archival Science, Library & Information Science, Records Management or Museology may be preferred or required."},{"type":"note","label":"Career positioning","text":"A BA History graduate can begin through Archive Assistant, Records Assistant, Digitisation Assistant, Research Assistant or Documentation Assistant roles and then specialise in archival management."}]},{"heading":"Career Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Details"],"rows":[[{"text":"Primary function"},{"text":"Preservation and management of historical/institutional records"}],[{"text":"Degree alignment"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Core disciplines"},{"text":"History, archival science, records management, preservation"}],[{"text":"Entry level"},{"text":"Archive Assistant / Archival Assistant / Records Assistant"}],[{"text":"Related roles"},{"text":"Documentation Assistant, Digitisation Assistant, Research Assistant"}],[{"text":"Work environments"},{"text":"Archives, libraries, museums, universities, government institutions, corporations"}],[{"text":"Key skills"},{"text":"Research, cataloguing, preservation, metadata, digitisation"}],[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Digital archives, databases, OCR, metadata systems, DAM/records systems"}],[{"text":"Long-term potential"},{"text":"Archivist → Senior Archivist → Archives Manager / Digital Archivist"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does an Archivist Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Archivists manage records that have long-term historical, legal, administrative, cultural or research value."},{"type":"p","text":"Their work can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Identifying valuable records"},{"text":"Appraising records"},{"text":"Acquiring archival collections"},{"text":"Arranging documents"},{"text":"Describing collections"},{"text":"Creating finding aids"},{"text":"Cataloguing archival materials"},{"text":"Preserving physical documents"},{"text":"Managing digital records"},{"text":"Digitising historical documents"},{"text":"Scanning photographs and manuscripts"},{"text":"Creating metadata"},{"text":"Maintaining archival databases"},{"text":"Supporting researchers"},{"text":"Managing access permissions"},{"text":"Handling fragile documents"},{"text":"Monitoring storage conditions"},{"text":"Preparing exhibitions"},{"text":"Supporting historical research"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Records may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manuscripts"},{"text":"Letters"},{"text":"Government files"},{"text":"Maps"},{"text":"Photographs"},{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Diaries"},{"text":"Audio recordings"},{"text":"Video"},{"text":"Institutional records"},{"text":"Digital files"},{"text":"Oral-history recordings"}]}]},{"heading":"Archivist vs Historian vs Librarian","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These careers overlap but are different."},{"type":"table","header":["Career","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Historian"},{"text":"Researches and interprets the past"}],[{"text":"Archivist"},{"text":"Preserves and manages original records"}],[{"text":"Librarian"},{"text":"Manages published information/resources and library services"}],[{"text":"Museum Curator"},{"text":"Manages and interprets museum collections"}],[{"text":"Records Manager"},{"text":"Manages organisational records throughout their lifecycle"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"A History graduate can move between these areas with appropriate additional training."}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During Your Degree","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Historical Research Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong historical knowledge."},{"type":"h","text":"Study"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ancient history"},{"text":"Medieval history"},{"text":"Modern history"},{"text":"Indian history"},{"text":"World history"},{"text":"Historiography"},{"text":"Historical sources"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Primary vs secondary sources"},{"text":"Source criticism"},{"text":"Citation"},{"text":"Bibliography"},{"text":"Historical chronology"},{"text":"Academic writing"},{"text":"Research methodology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical exercise"},{"type":"p","text":"Visit a local library, museum or historical collection and document:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collection type"},{"text":"Date/period"},{"text":"Source type"},{"text":"Condition"},{"text":"Historical significance"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Archival Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start learning how archives actually operate."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Archival principles"},{"text":"Records lifecycle"},{"text":"Collection development"},{"text":"Appraisal"},{"text":"Acquisition"},{"text":"Arrangement"},{"text":"Description"},{"text":"Cataloguing"},{"text":"Finding aids"},{"text":"Reference services"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand archival hierarchy"},{"type":"p","text":"A basic archival structure may involve:"},{"type":"h","text":"Repository"},{"type":"flow","items":["Collection","Series","File","Item"]},{"type":"p","text":"Understanding hierarchical organisation is important for archival work."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Preservation & Digitisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical technical skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Physical preservation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn basic concepts around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Paper preservation"},{"text":"Acid deterioration"},{"text":"Humidity"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Light exposure"},{"text":"Pest management"},{"text":"Handling procedures"},{"text":"Storage materials"},{"text":"Conservation principles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digitisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Document scanning"},{"text":"Image resolution"},{"text":"TIFF/JPEG/PDF"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"File naming"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Digital preservation"},{"text":"Backup"},{"text":"File integrity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital tools"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Database fundamentals"},{"text":"Digital asset management"},{"text":"OCR tools"},{"text":"Basic image editing"},{"text":"File management"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Digital Archives & Professional Practice","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"If the programme is four years, develop advanced digital capabilities."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Metadata standards"},{"text":"Digital preservation"},{"text":"Repository management"},{"text":"Digital collections"},{"text":"Search systems"},{"text":"Records management"},{"text":"Copyright"},{"text":"Access control"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Digitisation workflows"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Image processing"},{"text":"Digital humanities"},{"text":"GIS"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Python can be useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bulk file organisation"},{"text":"Metadata processing"},{"text":"OCR cleanup"},{"text":"Text extraction"},{"text":"Digital collection analysis"}]}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"History & research"},{"text":"Historical sources, research, writing"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Archival science"},{"text":"Appraisal, arrangement, description"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Preservation & digitisation"},{"text":"Conservation, scanning, OCR, metadata"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Digital archives"},{"text":"Databases, digital preservation, automation"}]]}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Digital Archive"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a small digital archive containing 50–100 historical documents."},{"type":"p","text":"For each item record:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Title"},{"text":"Date"},{"text":"Creator"},{"text":"Description"},{"text":"Subject"},{"text":"Location"},{"text":"Source"},{"text":"Rights"},{"text":"File format"},{"text":"Keywords"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates actual archival thinking."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Historical Photograph Archive"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a structured collection of historical photographs."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Photograph ID"},{"text":"Date"},{"text":"Location"},{"text":"People/events"},{"text":"Photographer/source"},{"text":"Description"},{"text":"Copyright status"},{"text":"Keywords"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Newspaper Archive"},{"type":"p","text":"Collect historical newspaper articles around one event."},{"type":"p","text":"Create metadata for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Date"},{"text":"Newspaper"},{"text":"Headline"},{"text":"Topic"},{"text":"Location"},{"text":"People"},{"text":"Event"},{"text":"Source"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build a searchable spreadsheet/database."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Digitisation Workflow"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simulated workflow:"},{"type":"h","text":"Physical document"},{"type":"flow","items":["Condition check","Scanning","File naming","OCR","Metadata","Quality check","Digital repository"]},{"type":"p","text":"Document the process as a professional SOP."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Archival Finding Aid"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a fictional or publicly available historical collection and create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collection description"},{"text":"Scope and content"},{"text":"Historical background"},{"text":"Series"},{"text":"Sub-series"},{"text":"Box/file structure"},{"text":"Access conditions"},{"text":"Finding aid"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is an excellent portfolio project."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internship experience is extremely valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"Target institutions"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Archives"},{"text":"Museums"},{"text":"Libraries"},{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Historical research institutions"},{"text":"Government repositories"},{"text":"Cultural organisations"},{"text":"Heritage organisations"},{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Corporate archives"},{"text":"Digital humanities projects"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful internship roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Archive Intern"},{"text":"Documentation Intern"},{"text":"Digitisation Intern"},{"text":"Research Intern"},{"text":"Records Management Intern"},{"text":"Museum Documentation Intern"},{"text":"Digital Humanities Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"What to Learn During an Internship","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Try to gain practical experience in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collection handling"},{"text":"Cataloguing"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Document scanning"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Digital preservation"},{"text":"Researcher requests"},{"text":"Finding aids"},{"text":"Archival storage"},{"text":"Records classification"},{"text":"Database management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal should be:"},{"type":"h","text":"“I can organise and describe a collection systematically.”"}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A certificate alone does not make someone an archivist."},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritise practical training in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Archival Science"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Archival management"},{"text":"Records management"},{"text":"Collection management"},{"text":"Preservation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Library & Information Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful concepts include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cataloguing"},{"text":"Classification"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Information retrieval"},{"text":"Digital libraries"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital preservation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"File formats"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Digital repositories"},{"text":"Backup"},{"text":"Integrity checks"},{"text":"Migration concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digitisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scanning standards"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Image processing"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Digital collection workflows"}]}]},{"heading":"Metadata Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Metadata is one of the most important technical skills for a modern archivist."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Descriptive metadata"},{"text":"Administrative metadata"},{"text":"Technical metadata"},{"text":"Preservation metadata"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful standards/frameworks to study include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dublin Core"},{"text":"EAD concepts"},{"text":"ISAD(G) concepts"},{"text":"PREMIS concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact standards used depend on the repository and collection."}]},{"heading":"Jobs You Can Be Hired For","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BA History graduate should search for several related job titles."},{"type":"h","text":"Entry-level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Archive Assistant"},{"text":"Archival Assistant"},{"text":"Records Assistant"},{"text":"Documentation Assistant"},{"text":"Digitisation Assistant"},{"text":"Research Assistant"},{"text":"Digital Archive Assistant"},{"text":"Collection Assistant"},{"text":"Museum Documentation Assistant"},{"text":"Library/Archive Assistant"},{"text":"Records Management Assistant"},{"text":"Heritage Documentation Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"With additional qualification"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Archivist"},{"text":"Digital Archivist"},{"text":"Records Manager"},{"text":"Archives Officer"},{"text":"Collections Manager"},{"text":"Documentation Officer"},{"text":"Archival Researcher"}]}]},{"heading":"Important Eligibility Distinction","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The title Archivist can mean different things across employers."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA History degree provides an excellent academic foundation, but some professional or government positions may require:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.A. History"},{"text":"M.A./PG Diploma in Archives"},{"text":"M.L.I.S./M.Lib.I.Sc."},{"text":"Archival Science"},{"text":"Records Management"},{"text":"Museology"},{"text":"Other specified qualifications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, always check the specific recruitment notification or job description."}]},{"heading":"Employer-Ready Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"History"},{"text":"Excellent"}],[{"text":"Historical research"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Primary-source analysis"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Archival principles"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Cataloguing"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Description"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Preservation"},{"text":"Working/Strong"}],[{"text":"Digitisation"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Working"}],[{"text":"Digital preservation"},{"text":"Working"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Database/SQL"},{"text":"Basic"}],[{"text":"Digital asset management"},{"text":"Working"}],[{"text":"Academic writing"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Research support"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Portfolio"},{"text":"Essential"}]]}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Digital Archivist"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["History","Archives","Technology"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital preservation"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Digital repositories"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Automation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the strongest future-oriented pathways."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Government Archivist"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government records"},{"text":"Public archives"},{"text":"Administrative history"},{"text":"Records management"},{"text":"Preservation"},{"text":"Public access"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Recruitment requirements vary by institution and position."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Corporate Archivist"},{"type":"p","text":"Companies maintain historical records such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business documents"},{"text":"Product records"},{"text":"Photographs"},{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"Corporate publications"},{"text":"Executive records"},{"text":"Historical correspondence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Archives","Business Records","Digital Asset Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"4. Museum Archivist"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Museum records"},{"text":"Collection documentation"},{"text":"Exhibition archives"},{"text":"Photographs"},{"text":"Manuscripts"},{"text":"Artefact documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. University Archivist"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Institutional history"},{"text":"Student records where permitted"},{"text":"Faculty records"},{"text":"Publications"},{"text":"Research collections"},{"text":"Photographs"},{"text":"Alumni archives"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Digital Humanities"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["History","Archives","Data","Technology"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible work includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital collections"},{"text":"Historical databases"},{"text":"Text mining"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Digital exhibitions"},{"text":"Cultural-data projects"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a serious professional archival career, postgraduate study can significantly strengthen the profile."},{"type":"h","text":"M.A. History"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Historical research"},{"text":"Archives"},{"text":"Museums"},{"text":"Heritage"},{"text":"Academia"}]},{"type":"p","text":"M.L.I.S. / M.Lib.I.Sc."},{"type":"p","text":"Highly relevant for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Archives"},{"text":"Libraries"},{"text":"Information management"},{"text":"Digital libraries"},{"text":"Documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.A./PG in Archives & Records Management"},{"type":"p","text":"The most directly specialised option where a recognised programme is available."},{"type":"h","text":"M.A. Museology"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Museums"},{"text":"Collections"},{"text":"Heritage"},{"text":"Documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Heritage Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cultural institutions"},{"text":"Heritage organisations"},{"text":"Digital heritage"},{"text":"Conservation management"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended PG Path","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For someone specifically targeting Archivist, a strong route is:"},{"type":"h","text":"BA History"},{"type":"h","text":"M.L.I.S./M.Lib.I.Sc. or specialised Archives & Records Management qualification"},{"type":"h","text":"Archive/Digitisation Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Archive Assistant / Records Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"Archivist / Digital Archivist"},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative research-oriented route"},{"type":"h","text":"BA History"},{"type":"h","text":"MA History"},{"type":"h","text":"Archival Studies + Digitisation"},{"type":"h","text":"Research/Archive Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"Archivist / Historical Researcher"}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant postgraduate areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Archival Studies"},{"text":"Library & Information Science"},{"text":"Records Management"},{"text":"Digital Humanities"},{"text":"Museum Studies"},{"text":"Heritage Studies"},{"text":"Public History"},{"text":"Digital Preservation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Particularly valuable combinations include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Archives + Digital Humanities"},{"type":"h","text":"Archives + Information Science"},{"type":"h","text":"Archives + Digital Preservation"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A typical pathway can be:"},{"type":"h","text":"BA History"},{"type":"h","text":"Archive/Digitisation Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Archive Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"Archivist"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Archivist"},{"type":"h","text":"Archives Officer / Digital Archivist"},{"type":"h","text":"Archives Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Archives / Collections"}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Path — Digital Archivist","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"History Graduate"},{"type":"flow","items":["Digitisation Assistant","Digital Archive Assistant","Digital Archivist","Senior Digital Archivist","Digital Collections Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"This route benefits strongly from:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Digital preservation"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Digital asset management"}]}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Path — Records Management","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"History"},{"type":"flow","items":["Records Assistant","Records Analyst","Records Management Executive","Records Manager","Information Governance Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly relevant to corporations and regulated organisations."}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Path — Museum & Heritage","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"History"},{"type":"flow","items":["Museum Documentation Assistant","Collections Assistant","Museum/Heritage Professional","Collections Specialist","Curatorial/Heritage Management"]},{"type":"p","text":"A relevant postgraduate qualification can be important for specialist positions."}]},{"heading":"AI & Future Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will significantly affect archival workflows."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential applications include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Handwritten text recognition"},{"text":"Automatic metadata extraction"},{"text":"Document classification"},{"text":"Named-entity extraction"},{"text":"Historical text search"},{"text":"Image recognition"},{"text":"Duplicate detection"},{"text":"Automatic transcription"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Digital collection discovery"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Historical document"},{"type":"flow","items":["Scan","OCR/AI handwriting recognition","Extract names/dates/places","Generate metadata","Human verification","Digital repository"]},{"type":"p","text":"The human archivist remains responsible for context, accuracy, provenance, appraisal and preservation decisions."}]},{"heading":"AI-Era Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The future archivist should combine:"},{"type":"h","text":"Historical expertise"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"History"},{"text":"Source criticism"},{"text":"Contextual interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Archival expertise"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Appraisal"},{"text":"Arrangement"},{"text":"Description"},{"text":"Preservation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital expertise"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Digital repositories"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Document classification"},{"text":"Entity extraction"},{"text":"Handwriting recognition"},{"text":"Search"},{"text":"Text analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Power BI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates the profile of a:"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Archivist / Digital Collections Specialist"},{"type":"p","text":"rather than a purely paper-based archival professional."}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should be able to say:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I understand historical research and archival principles, can organise and describe collections, create metadata and finding aids, support physical preservation and digitisation, use OCR and digital archive systems, and apply data and AI tools responsibly to improve access to historical records.”"},{"type":"p","text":"That profile provides opportunities across:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Archives","Museums","Libraries","Heritage","Digital Humanities","Records Management."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Best Practical Path","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BA History"},{"type":"flow","items":["Build strong historical research skills","Learn archival principles","Learn cataloguing and description","Learn metadata","Learn preservation basics","Learn digitisation + OCR","Gain archive/museum/library internship","Learn Excel + databases + SQL","Learn QGIS / digital humanities as an advantage","Build a Digital Archive Project","Build an Archival Finding Aid","Apply for:"]},{"type":"h","text":"Archive Assistant / Records Assistant / Digitisation Assistant / Documentation Assistant"},{"type":"flow","items":["Pursue M.L.I.S./M.Lib.I.Sc., Archives & Records Management, or MA History depending on target","Gain professional archival experience","Specialise in:"]},{"type":"p","text":"Digital Archives / Government Archives / Corporate Archives / Museum Archives / Records Management\n→ Progress toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Archivist","Senior Archivist","Archives Officer/Manager","Head of Archives"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best AI-era combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["History","Archival Science","Metadata","Digitisation","Digital Preservation","AI/OCR","Data Skills"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For this particular career, the most practical upgrade from a BA History is to combine historical knowledge with professional archival training and digital-archive skills."}]}]}